==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|pot shot|pot-shot}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|pot|shot}}. 1858, shot taken for the (cooking) [[pot]], namely for food; see {{m|en|pothunter}}.<ref name="oetyld">{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref> Sense “opportunistic criticism” from 1926.<ref name="oetyld" />

